  "help_faq1A": "Aad Jadwalkaygii oo ku taabo badhanka «Ku Biir» ee kaadhka xilligaaga soo socda. Waqtiga sax ah jooji — badhanka wuu firfircoonayaa 5 daqiiqo ka hor fasalka.",
  "help_faq2Q": "Sidee ayaa fasalka tababarka AI-ga lagu calaamadeeyaa?",
  "help_faq2A": "AI-ga wuxuu dhageysdaa akhriskaagas oo ku barbar dhigaa qoraalka. Adiga kula-xisaabtami kartaa badhannada Sax / Khalad Yar / Khalad adiga oo isticmaalaya. Dhibcahaaga iyo saxnaantaadu waa la kaydiyaa horumarkaaga.",
  "help_faq3Q": "Sidee macallinkaygii fariin ugu dirayaa?",
  "help_faq3A": "Fur tabka Farriimaha ka gashiga hoose. Taabo magaca macallinkaaga si aad u furto sheekada. Dhammaan macallimiintaada halkaas ayaa ku jira.",
  "help_faq4Q": "Maxay yihiin abaalmarinnada sidaase u heli karaa?",
  "help_faq4A": "Abaalmarinnada waa abaal guud oo loo helo gaaritaanka yoolalka — sida dhammaystirada Suurad, ilaalintu silsilad, ama hesho dhibco sare. Booqo Abaalmarinnadadii profiilkaaga si aad u aragto waxa xiga.",
  "help_faq5Q": "Xaadirnimadayda si khaldan ayaa loo calaamadeeyay. Maxaan samayn?",
  "help_faq5A": "La xiriir macallinkaaga si toos ah tabka Farriimaha. Wuxuu cusboonaysiiyaa diiwaanka xaadirnimadaada. Fasalka sidoo kale taasi kaga xuso.",
  "help_faq6Q": "Sidee erayga sirta dib u dejiyaa?",
  "help_faq6A": "Aad Profiilka → Dejinta → Erayga Sirta Beddel. Haddaad illoowday, isticmaal fursadda «Ma illoowday erayga sirta?» ee shaashada galitaanka.",
  "help_faq7Q": "App-ka ma isticmaali karaa internet la'aanteed?",
  "help_faq7A": "Qaarkood sida jadwalka iyo horumarku ma diyaarsan yihiin offline. Laakiin fasalada tooska ah, tababarka AI, iyo xarriiqda internet ayaa u baahan.",
